ENTITY CX6A
QUALIFY CX6A kind context
QUALIFY CX6A type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX6A base_type tau_A
QUALIFY CX6A distinguishes_type tau_A
QUALIFY CX6A member A1
QUALIFY CX6A member A2
QUALIFY CX6A member A3
QUALIFY CX6A member A4
QUALIFY CX6A member A5

ENTITY CX6V
QUALIFY CX6V kind context
QUALIFY CX6V type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX6V base_type tau_V
QUALIFY CX6V distinguishes_type tau_V
QUALIFY CX6V member V1
QUALIFY CX6V member V2
QUALIFY CX6V member V3

ENTITY CX6
QUALIFY CX6 kind context
QUALIFY CX6 type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX6 base_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CX6 distinguishes_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CX6 member A1V1
QUALIFY CX6 member A1V2
QUALIFY CX6 member A1V3
QUALIFY CX6 member A2V1
QUALIFY CX6 member A2V2
QUALIFY CX6 member A2V3
QUALIFY CX6 member A3V1
QUALIFY CX6 member A3V2
QUALIFY CX6 member A3V3
QUALIFY CX6 member A4V1
QUALIFY CX6 member A4V2
QUALIFY CX6 member A4V3
QUALIFY CX6 member A5V1
QUALIFY CX6 member A5V2
QUALIFY CX6 member A5V3

ENTITY U14
QUALIFY U14 kind stream
QUALIFY U14 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U14 I0 A1V1
AT U14 I1 A2V3
AT U14 I2 A3V2

ENTITY U15
QUALIFY U15 kind stream
QUALIFY U15 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U15 I0 A2V2
AT U15 I1 A3V1
AT U15 I2 A4V3

ENTITY U16
QUALIFY U16 kind stream
QUALIFY U16 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U16 I0 A3V3
AT U16 I1 A4V1

ENTITY T6
QUALIFY T6 kind task
QUALIFY T6 context CX6
QUALIFY T6 input U14
QUALIFY T6 input U15
QUALIFY T6 input U16

UNKNOWN_AT T6 X6 U16 I2 Pair(tau_A,tau_V)

CONSTRAINT COMPONENT_RELATION C6A U16 1 RA1
QUALIFY T6 constraint C6A
